    <item>
      <title>Canada has legal duty to provide safe water, housing to remote First Nations, federal judge rules</title>
      <link>https://www.cbc.ca/news/canada/manitoba/st-theresa-point-shamattawa-sandy-lake-first-nation-class-action-ruling-9.7005716?cmp=rss</link>
